BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Free Estate Planning Webnar
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260623T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260623T183000
UID:cdc2bf00b8c2d3cb69612ed97ae5f9af@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Creating your estate plan\, whether it’s a living trust or a
  will\, can be a daunting task. Estate planning addresses issues that are 
 difficult to think about\, such as death\, incapacity\, finances\, and fam
 ily dynamics. It can be easy to procrastinate\, even though these issues m
 ay weigh heavily on your mind. We invite you to attend one of our upcoming
  free webinars so you can take the first step toward having peace of mind 
 by creating (or updating) your estate plan. This is an educational webinar
 \, where we highlight some of the concerns that many families face and how
  an estate plan can help. The attorneys also break down how wills and trus
 ts differ\, and some of the common estate planning pitfalls and how to avo
 id them.
LOCATION:Petaluma\, CA
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.us/events/details/free-estate-plannin
 g-webnar
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
